Verse 3:
[Ab]I've found [Eb7]a Friend; oh, [Ab]such a Friend!
[Db]All [Ab]power to [Eb7]Him [Ab]is given;
[Eb7]To [Ab]guard [Db]me [Bb]on [Ab]my [Eb]upward course,
[Eb7]And [Ab]bring [Db]me [Ab]safe [Eb7]to [Ab]heaven.
