[Db]To [Ab]nerve [Eb7]my [Ab]faint endeavor;
[Eb7]So [Ab]now [Db]to watch, [Bb]to [Ab]work, [Eb]to war,
[Eb7][Ab]And [Db]then [Ab]to [Eb7]rest [Ab]forever.

Verse 4:
[Ab]I've found [Eb7]a Friend; oh, [Ab]such a Friend!
[Db]So [Ab]kind, and [Eb7]true, [Ab]and tender,
[Eb7]So [Ab]wise [Db]a [Bb]counselor [Ab]and [Eb]guide,
